        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Greg Anthony, Jim Jackson, Stacey Augmon\n- Organizations: Portland Trail Blazers, Vancouver Grizzlies, Seattle SuperSonics, CBS Sports, UNLV, NBA\n- Roles: free agent, player, television analyst, coach\n- Topics: NBA offseason transactions, career background\n\nFacts:\n- Greg Anthony was born on November 15, 1967.\n- Greg Anthony is an American former NBA player and later became a television analyst for CBS Sports.\n- Greg Anthony and Stacey Augmon were former teammates at UNLV.\n- During the 1998–99 Portland Trail Blazers offseason, the Trail Blazers signed free agents Jim Jackson and Greg Anthony.\n- Greg Anthony’s signing with the Portland Trail Blazers reunited him with Stacey Augmon.\n- Following the 1996–97 Vancouver Grizzlies season, Greg Anthony signed with the Seattle SuperSonics as a free agent.\n- Following the 1996–97 Vancouver Grizzlies season, Jackson was fired as coach.",
